ensity lipoproteins (HDL) more efficiently than other lipoproteins (PubMed:10192396, PubMed:12032167)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}